1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
This temple is older than the city.
这座寺，比广州还老

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,200
"First Guangxiao, then Guangzhou."
未有羊城，先有光孝

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,500
Stop 1 of my Guangzhou heritage route.
广州古迹一日·第一站

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,800
Guangxiao Temple: over 1,700 years old.
光孝寺，一千七百多年

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,100
Here the Sixth Zen Patriarch was ordained.
六祖慧能在此剃度

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,400
His hair is buried beneath a pagoda.
瘗发塔，埋着他的头发

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,700
Come at dawn, before the tour buses.
清晨先到，避开旅行团

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,000
Then walk the route, stop by stop.
再沿线路，一站一站走

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,600
★ Expert Tip: enter right at opening — the bodhi courtyard is empty, the light best.
内行提示：一开门就进，菩提庭院最静，光最好

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,400
Full heritage route on the channel page.
完整线路，主页可见
